      "say": "Node provides some globals out of the box. Process describes the running program. Dirname and filename give the current file's location in CommonJS modules. Global this is the global object, and console, timers, and fetch are all built in.",
      "voice": "/audio/node-02-running-code/globals.wav"
    },
